# Batch 7: the system displays reached from any screen: the System
# Request menu and its options, the Attention program, Display Program
# Messages (a SNDMSG to the user's queue with a break), DSPSGNINF-like
# panels, and the sign-off confirmation.
wait "Main Menu"
continue
timeout 60000
key sysreq
settle 1500
snap sysreq-menu
key f1
settle 1500
snap sysreq-help
key f3
settle 800
key f12
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 3
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-3-dspjob +jobnum
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 4
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-4-dspmsg
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 5
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-5-sndmsg
key f12
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 6
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-6-qsysopr
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 7
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-7-wrkstnusr +jobnum
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
key sysreq
settle 1200
type 80
key enter
settle 1500
snap sysreq-80
key f12
wait "Main Menu"
key attn
settle 2000
snap attn-program
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
type sndmsg msg('A break message for the capture') tousr({user})
key enter
settle 3000
snap break-message
key enter
settle 1500
key f3
settle 800
type dspsgninf
key enter
settle 1500
snap dspsgninf
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
type chgpwd
key enter
settle 1500
snap chgpwd
key f12
wait "Main Menu"
type go cmdsignoff
key enter
settle 1500
snap menu-cmdsignoff
key f3
wait "Main Menu"
type signoff
key f4
settle 1500
snap prompt-signoff
key f12
wait "Main Menu"
type signoff
key enter
settle 1500
